course: dictionary
lesson: 13831
title: An old letter name
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some old words are no longer used today, but you can still find them in old books and word puzzles. Izzard is one of them. It is an old name for the letter Z.
explain: Look at the phrase «from A to izzard». It means from start to finish, just like «from A to Z». The clue is the A at the start, so izzard must be the last letter, Z.
explain: Today most people say zed for the letter Z in the UK, Australia, Canada, Ireland and New Zealand, and zee in the USA. Izzard is also a surname, which is a family name, like Smith.
fact: Izzard is a noun, and it is an old word that is rare today.
fact: Izzard is an old name for the letter Z.
fact: «From A to izzard» meant from start to finish.
fact: Izzard is also a surname, a family name carried by some people.
fact: Today most people say zed or zee for the letter Z.
exercise: In an old book, the words «from A to izzard» were written at the end of a long story. What did they mean? | Only the first letter | Very quickly | From a long way away | * From start to finish
exercise: An old word puzzle asked, «Find the letter called izzard.» Which letter is it? | Q | * Z | M | A
exercise: Today people in the UK and Australia say zed for the letter Z. What do they say for it? | Izzard | Ex | Zoo | * Zed
test: Dad said, «Izzard is an old name for the letter Z.» What is izzard? | The letter A | A long road | A kind of fish | * An old name for the letter Z
test: «Ellie's teacher is Mr Izzard.» What kind of word is izzard here? | A colour | A letter | * A surname, a family name | A verb
exam: Which letter did old writers call izzard? | B | Y | X | * Z
